<title>NETHERLANDS: HAL FIRST-HALF NET FALLS TO $52.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>HAL FIRST-HALF NET FALLS TO $52.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (dollars)		0.83 vs   0.97</p>
<p>    Net profit			    52.6  vs  61.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment group HAL Holding NV had not given a 1996</p>
<p>forecast previously.</p>
<p>    Turnover			     101.1  vs 136.4</p>
<p>    Investment income		   57.0  vs  38.8</p>
<p>    Income from minority interests   4.9  vs  39.1</p>
<p>    Property income			1.7  vs   1.0</p>
<p>    Operating costs		     91.4  vs 137.2</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     7.1  vs   9.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Investment group HAL Holding NV said it could not</p>
<p>give a forecast for the 1996 full-year result.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
